{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369480/extras/c0e29983cf2a1c3f14d438dccde18303.avif?t=1770402943\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GNOMONIC</strong></i><strong> - The Art RPG!</strong> In this <strong>ART-PG</strong>, walk through <strong>watercolor paintings</strong>, fight in <strong>real-time projectile battles</strong>, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with shadows, meet <strong>friends </strong>with creative talents in <strong>worlds</strong> themed by artistic mediums<strong>, </strong>and discover a <strong>story about how we experience art</strong>... <br>and <strong>how art experiences us</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot equipped projectiles down lanes to simultaneously attack and defend!</strong> Every enemy-type has unique attacks and their own battlefields, from projectiles that jump between lanes or burrow underground to battlefield orientations with more to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize how you battle with Stuff that you can equip to three projectile slots, Specials that allow you to use one powerful ability, and Dials that provide passive effects!</strong> Find them dropped around the world or dropped by defeated enemies, allowing you to use enemy projectiles and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast your shadow over objects for special interactions and puzzle solving!</strong> And discover new abilities that will allow you to traverse new obstacles and solve more puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throughout it all, a prophecy persists: \u201cLIGHT will unite with SHADE and free the GNOMON.\u201d But... \ud835\ude86\ud835\ude91\ud835\ude8a\ud835\ude9d \ud835\ude92\ud835\ude9c \ud835\ude8a \ud835\ude76\ud835\ude7d\ud835\ude7e\ud835\ude7c\ud835\ude7e\ud835\ude7d?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1369480?t=1770402943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1369480?t=1770402943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369480/cd788a4afbb6369580704f84d027611f9434b89a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770402943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369480/cd788a4afbb6369580704f84d027611f9434b89a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770402943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369480/extras/c0e29983cf2a1c3f14d438dccde18303.avif?t=1770402943\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GNOMONIC</strong></i><strong> - The Art RPG!</strong> In this <strong>ART-PG</strong>, walk through <strong>watercolor paintings</strong>, fight in <strong>real-time projectile battles</strong>, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with shadows, meet <strong>friends </strong>with creative talents in <strong>worlds</strong> themed by artistic mediums<strong>, </strong>and discover a <strong>story about how we experience art</strong>... <br>and <strong>how art experiences us</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot equipped projectiles down lanes to simultaneousl